    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Dragon Uprising Online!</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the <strong>Playtest</strong> version of <strong>Dragon Uprising Online</strong>! Developed solo, this project is a labor of love, created to explore its potential and gather feedback. If the concept resonates with players, I'll consider further development and enhancements. Dive in and join the adventure! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dragon Uprising Online</strong> is all about teaming up with friends to tackle epic boss battles in cooperative multiplayer. Create your unique character, customize their appearance and gear, and embark on thrilling adventures together. Whether you're seeking glory, loot, or just good times with pals, this game has something for everyone. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Character Customization:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/cf3f5a5911902395d21a5613ee31f6e6.avif?t=1736384865\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personalize your avatar and gear to stand out in style. While customization options are currently limited, future updates may expand them based on player interest and community contributions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Village HUB:</u></strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/e95ac3f7fda29b464cc56f88ad88519c.avif?t=1736384865\" /></div>Gather in the central hub to meet NPCs, pick up quests, and craft items. Play offline or join dedicated servers to interact with other players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Crafting and Upgrading:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/de513d122f8602c937ac5b964262e335.avif?t=1736384865\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft and enhance your equipment by communicating with specific NPCs. Experiment with theorycrafting using gemstones and unlockable slots. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/701224785368e8f3852b05dbe80e6aab.avif?t=1736384865\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/a586c99fb32fce8b81983c407872f13d.avif?t=1736384865\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Multiclass System:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/df9f24f0d2d88929fa2ba830ad9b826c.avif?t=1736384865\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/d061949d369b9244fe77893847f23462.avif?t=1736384865\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between different classes, each with unique stats and active/passive abilities. Experiment with diverse playstyles and combinations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Weapon Mastery:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/d8a65db74459250c0a7db9d6086b436f.avif?t=1736384865\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master up to four weapons per gameplay session, out of eight available types. Each weapon has its own skills and combos, offering endless strategic possibilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/38489d27271626e6c79b1501d38da6a2.avif?t=1736384865\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Combat Mechanics:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/75516fd88454dbc95997de8f9c63fcc4.poster.avif?t=1736384865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/75516fd88454dbc95997de8f9c63fcc4.webm?t=1736384865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/75516fd88454dbc95997de8f9c63fcc4.mp4?t=1736384865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chain up to three skills per key press, with six total keys for each weapon type. Unleash devastating combos and unleash the full potential of your arsenal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Elemental System:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/c3f88192c70f32085fb5441b13861850.poster.avif?t=1736384865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/c3f88192c70f32085fb5441b13861850.webm?t=1736384865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/c3f88192c70f32085fb5441b13861850.mp4?t=1736384865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness the power of elemental attributes to enhance your spells and abilities, influencing gameplay dynamics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Boss Challenges:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/f4309c21188bd30dbeedaef78817cf4e.avif?t=1736384865\" /></div>Take on bosses of varying difficulty levels, each with their own rankings and rewards. Challenge yourself in modulated difficulty levels for increased XP and loot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Drop Bar System:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/f293325d9cd139f6676e722aa3654fc9.avif?t=1736384865\" /></div>Eliminate excessive grinding with a drop bar mechanic. Fill the bar to guarantee a weapon drop from bosses, ensuring a fair reward system for players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Build System:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/1c821493c39954d3288c14f2dd83d233.avif?t=1736384865\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize multiple builds for your character, each with its own set of gear and class parameters. Easily switch between presets for different playstyles and situations. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join the Playtest today and become part of the Dragon Uprising community!</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Dragon Uprising Online!</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About the Game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the <strong>Playtest</strong> version of <strong>Dragon Uprising Online</strong>! Developed solo, this project is a labor of love, created to explore its potential and gather feedback. If the concept resonates with players, I'll consider further development and enhancements. Dive in and join the adventure! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Overview:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dragon Uprising Online</strong> is all about teaming up with friends to tackle epic boss battles in cooperative multiplayer. Create your unique character, customize their appearance and gear, and embark on thrilling adventures together. Whether you're seeking glory, loot, or just good times with pals, this game has something for everyone. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Character Customization:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/cf3f5a5911902395d21a5613ee31f6e6.avif?t=1736384865\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personalize your avatar and gear to stand out in style. While customization options are currently limited, future updates may expand them based on player interest and community contributions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Village HUB:</u></strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/e95ac3f7fda29b464cc56f88ad88519c.avif?t=1736384865\" /></div>Gather in the central hub to meet NPCs, pick up quests, and craft items. Play offline or join dedicated servers to interact with other players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Crafting and Upgrading:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/de513d122f8602c937ac5b964262e335.avif?t=1736384865\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft and enhance your equipment by communicating with specific NPCs. Experiment with theorycrafting using gemstones and unlockable slots. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/701224785368e8f3852b05dbe80e6aab.avif?t=1736384865\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/a586c99fb32fce8b81983c407872f13d.avif?t=1736384865\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Multiclass System:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/df9f24f0d2d88929fa2ba830ad9b826c.avif?t=1736384865\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/d061949d369b9244fe77893847f23462.avif?t=1736384865\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between different classes, each with unique stats and active/passive abilities. Experiment with diverse playstyles and combinations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Weapon Mastery:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/d8a65db74459250c0a7db9d6086b436f.avif?t=1736384865\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"b