e=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness the power of elemental attributes to enhance your spells and abilities, influencing gameplay dynamics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Boss Challenges:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/f4309c21188bd30dbeedaef78817cf4e.avif?t=1736384865\" /></div>Take on bosses of varying difficulty levels, each with their own rankings and rewards. Challenge yourself in modulated difficulty levels for increased XP and loot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Drop Bar System:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/f293325d9cd139f6676e722aa3654fc9.avif?t=1736384865\" /></div>Eliminate excessive grinding with a drop bar mechanic. Fill the bar to guarantee a weapon drop from bosses, ensuring a fair reward system for players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Build System:</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1932300/extras/1c821493c39954d3288c14f2dd83d233.avif?t=1736384865\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize multiple builds for your character, each with its own set of gear and class parameters. Easily switch between presets for different playstyles and situations. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Join the Playtest today and become part of the Dragon Uprising community!</strong></h2>",
